---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Pic from '../components/Pic.astro';
---

<Base title="BORP Summer Cycling Program 2026">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 class="visually-hidden">BORP Summer Cycling Program 2026</h1>
      <div class="text">
        <p>BORP is hosting a series of 16 group rides in San Jose in 2026. These range from manual only pick your own adventure independent rides to 35+ mile group electric-assist rides.</p>
        <p>NOTE: South Bay residents can get the $25 BORP membership fee waived, just e-mail <a href="mailto:info@borp.org">info@borp.org</a> with your address.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-wrap"><a class="btn" href="https://forms.gle/EHX7SRTLW4utywUW6">Sign Up Today</a></div>
      <Pic src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_5181-Medium.jpeg" alt="" sizes="(min-width: 680px) 640px, 100vw" class="photo" />
      <div class="text">
        <p>Able Bodied is partnering with BORP on three of those rides for longer “advanced” rides. The first of which was a 38 mile ride to Los Altos (<a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/muqLjgzTN9vva9tt9">pics</a>). To sign up for an advance long distance electric assist ride, please first have at least one 1:1 lesson at <a href="/#services">Able Bodied</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="embed">
        <iframe
          src="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vSx6xt0ZpOLojfDp6j7DtOBp-FSqoTNx7k6EBbM9070Z6uhPPxz6NgxwmTSmLoRdBdaW5DN3BDO1K3L/pubhtml?widget=true&headers=false"
          title="BORP 2026 ride schedule"
          loading="lazy"></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  :global(.photo) {
    margin: 10px auto 20px;
    max-width: 640px;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .embed iframe {
    min-height: 700px;
  }
</style>
